OL,4,CAirport customers hit by payment data  
OL,5,Cbreach                                 
OL,6,GA data breach affecting a third-party  
OL,7,Gpayment system used for Gatwick        
OL,8,GAirport drop-off charges is being      
OL,9,Ginvestigated, the airport has          
OL,10,Gconfirmed.                             
OL,12,FThe incident has resulted in the       
OL,13,Fpersonal data of some customers being  
OL,14,Faccessed, a spokesman for the airport  
OL,15,Fin West Sussex said.                   
OL,17,FThey said the data included login      
OL,18,Fcredentials, email and home addresses, 
OL,19,Fdetails of cars registered on the      
OL,20,Fsystem and in some cases payment card  
OL,21,Finformation.                           
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
