OL,4,CDead fish found at lake sparks         
OL,5,Cinvestigation                          
OL,6,GThe Environment Agency (EA) says       
OL,7,Ginvestigations are ongoing after fish  
OL,8,Gand eels were found dead at a lake in  
OL,9,GSurrey.                                
OL,11,FThe person who reported the incident   
OL,12,Fto the EA said they found the animals, 
OL,13,Fwhich included large carp, on Saturday 
OL,14,Fat Boldermere Lake near Wisley.        
OL,16,FThe EA said it took samples from the   
OL,17,Flake and its investigations were       
OL,18,Fongoing.                               
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
